BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_316790214@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041402Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316790214/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261001T013006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T013006Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_316651611@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041402Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T220000
SUMMARY:Blind scream haunted house night
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nPrepare for a nigh
 t of spine-chilling thrills as we take on the Blind Scream Haunted House i
 n Santa Rosa! Join us for an unforgettable experience filled with scares\,
  screams\, and lots of fun—if you dare.\n\nWith eerie corridors\, terrif
 ying actors\, and heart-pounding surprises at every turn\, this haunted ho
 use promises a frightful adventure for everyone. Whether you’re a haunte
 d house pro or it’s your first time\, come share the thrills with friend
 s.\n\nThe haunted house costs 25 dollars to go through so come prepared fo
 r that. we will meet just outside of the venue around 8 and go through tog
 ether.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316651611/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260921T160107Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T160107Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
